# Core (`@umetrica/core`)

## Role

Single source of truth for cross-app contracts:
- Zod schemas in `src/schemas.ts` (widgets, dashboards, insights)
- `buildWidgetQuery()` in `src/build-widget-query.ts`

## Conventions

- Export types via `z.infer<typeof Schema>`
- Widget fields: `measures`, `dimensions`, `timeDimension`, `dateRange`, `granularity`, `filters`, `chartType`
- Changes here affect API validation, Studio forms, and Cube queries — update all consumers

## Chart types

`line`, `bar`, `area`, `kpi`, `pie`, `donut` — keep in sync with Studio renderer and editor.
